{
  "id": "book-30",
  "checkpoint": 14,
  "title": "Arriving at the Base Camp",
  "summary": "Paul desce a encosta da montanha antes do anoitecer, chega ao acampamento base, registra-se na recepção e monta sua barraca ao redor da fogueira.",
  "audio_url": "/audios/book-30.mp3",
  "word_count_target": 140,
  "story_en": "Paul descends the gentle slope as evening approaches. The golden rays of the setting sun touch the wooden cabins of the base camp. Smoke rises from a central campfire where several travelers gather.\n\nHe enters the main office to register his stay. A friendly manager checks his name on a list and hands him a wooden key. “Welcome, traveler. You can pitch your tent near the western trees or rent a cabin bed.”\n\n“I will sleep in my tent tonight,” Paul replies with a smile.\n\nHe walks to the grassy clearing, unpacks his gear, and sets up his small shelter. Other hikers greet him warmly and invite him to share warm vegetable soup by the fire.\n\nSitting under the emerging stars, Paul feels deep satisfaction after completing a long day of travel.",
